{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"A\n    \n      Modal Composer (Postiz style)\n      Click \"New Post\" → modal opens over current view. Compose text, add media, pick platforms, set schedule, preview, publish. Dismissible — calendar stays underneath.\n      \n        Modal over calendar\n        \n          \n          \n          \n          \n            \n              Mon\n              Tue\n              Wed\n              Thu\n              Fri\n              Sat\n              Sun\n            \n          \n          \n          \n            \n              New Post\n              ✕\n            \n            \n              \n              \n                in\n                𝕏\n                ig\n              \n              \n              \n                Write your post here...\n              \n              \n              \n                \n                  🖼️\n                  🎬\n                  😊\n                \n                \n                  📅 Schedule\n                  Publish Now\n                \n              \n            \n          \n        \n      \n      \n        ProsQuick — doesn't navigate awayProven pattern (Postiz, Buffer, Hootsuite)Can open from anywhere (calendar click, button)\n        ConsLimited space for preview + editor side-by-side","choice":"a","id":null,"timestamp":1774525679391}
